### Phase 3: Strategy Template Library

#### [NEW] `frontend/src/components/strategy/template-library.tsx`

Instead of (or in addition to) the 6 basic goal cards, offer a library of **sophisticated, pre-built strategy templates** inspired by real institutional approaches:

| Template | Description | Factors Used |
|----------|-------------|-------------|
| **Coffee Can Portfolio** | Buy-and-forget quality stocks held for 10+ years | ROE > 15%, Revenue growth > 10%, Low debt |
| **Dividend Aristocrats India** | Companies with consistent dividend growth | Dividend yield, payout ratio, earnings stability |
| **GARP (Growth at Reasonable Price)** | High growth but not overvalued | PEG ratio proxy, earnings growth, PE < 25 |
| **Momentum + Quality** | Trending stocks with solid fundamentals | 12-month momentum, ROE, operating margin |
| **Low Volatility Shield** | Defensive portfolio for uncertain times | Low beta, low volatility, high margin of safety |
| **Small Cap Hidden Gems** | Under-the-radar quality small caps | Market cap < 5000 Cr, ROE > 18%, revenue growth |
| **Contrarian Value** | Out-of-favor quality at bargain prices | Low P/B, low P/E, high ROE (quality trap filter) |
| **Sector Rotation** | Momentum-based sector allocation | Sector momentum, breadth, relative strength |

Each template comes with:
- Pre-filled filters and ranking weights
- A clear explanation of the investment thesis
- Historical context of when this strategy works best
- Risk warnings and suitability notes

Users can load a template and then customize it through the AI chat.

